1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
For all time the Lao people have glorified their Fatherland,

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,500
united in heart, spirit and vigour as one.

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:20,000
Resolutely and increasing the dignity of the Lao people

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
and proclaiming the right to be their own masters, the Lao people of all origins are equal,

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000
and will no longer allow imperialists and traitors to harm them.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000
The entire people will safeguard the independence and the freedom of the Lao nation.

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:50,000
They are resolved to struggle for victory in order to lead the nation to prosperity.